    provider and the tree-sitter adapter (src/ui/highlighter.rs).

zcode changed these files: paths and visibility for a standalone crate, the
editing actions and InputEvent shared with gpui-base rather than redefined,
an element that renders only the code editor, the macOS text-content-type
hook removed, and the extension points described in docs/editor-engine.md
(gutter decorations, anchors, inlays and blocks, highlight layers, public
undo/redo, transactions and read-only mode, keystroke interception and
cursor shapes, the excerpt model). No code from Zed (GPL) is included.
